  - Citation content dominates when the focus is on leveraging existing resources (as in most computer vision/ML papers).

### Recommendation for Clarity:
To strengthen the technical component in future work, explicitly state *why* the augmentation steps are novel (e.g., "Our rotation-flip augmentation addresses the bias in medical images, unlike standard techniques"). This would increase technical content to 40–50% while reducing citation content to 50–60%, which is more typical for impactful methods sections.

